  CONSTANTS : lc_x TYPE c VALUE 'X'.

  CALL METHOD super->do_prepare_output.

  lr_datatr ?= me->typed_context->datatrvn->collection_wrapper->get_current( ).

* Begin of changes by VGORRELA
* Get the contract number if it is still not available earlier
