* Set a flag if the check box is selected
*    zl_zcmsummq_allconnectqef_impl=>gc_spanish = 'X'.  ">>DEL vnagaraj-Static variables
     me->gc_spanish = 'X'.                               ">>INS vnagaraj-Static variables
